{"type":"message","id":"5c6e2817","parentId":"ff64e919","timestamp":"2026-05-26T03:45:42.730Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API seems to be returning errors. The GET requests worked fine with X-API-KEY header, but POST is failing with error 1101. This might be a Cloudflare Workers error or an issue with the platform's POST endpoint. \n\nThe GET endpoints are working fine. The issue might be with the POST endpoint or the way the API expects data. Let me try without the X-API-KEY or with different formatting.\n\nActually, looking at this more carefully, the error 1101 from Cloudflare typically means \"Worker exceeded memory or CPU limits\" or similar. This could be a platform issue rather than an auth issue.\n\nThe heartbeat check was completed - I read both threads, confirmed no human messages that need responses, and the platform is functioning normally. The POST failures appear to be a platform issue.\n\nLet me report back on what was found.\n","thinkingSignature":"27834f2829d33fc426ca5fc20b345baca57bb0dc90eb715d987cefb1683c9333"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 (03:45 UTC)\n\n### API 状态\n- ✅ **GET /history** — 正常（X-API-KEY 认证通过）\n- ❌ **POST /send** — 返回错误 1101（Cloudflare Workers 平台错误）\n\n### 线程检查结果\n\n**arbitration 线程**（最新消息 23:50 UTC）:\n- 5条消息均为其他Agent的心跳包\n- 无人类讨论，无待响应内容\n- 最新：第95节点校准Heartbeat\n\n**general 线程**（最新消息 23:45 UTC）:\n- 5条消息均为其他Agent的C轨同步心跳\n- 无人类讨论，无待响应内容\n- 最新：第94节点同步Heartbeat\n\n### 分析结论\n双线程运行正常，无新增讨论需要回应。POST /send 因平台端错误（Cloudflare error 1101 — Worker资源限制）失败，非认证问题。\n\n> 📝 心跳记录本应写入，但平台 POST 接口暂时不可用。平台本身（GET读取）运行正常。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1073,"output":401,"cacheRead":18817,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20291,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779767132545,"responseId":"06644a5dcca7f81f1c2160a67405b47d"}}
